+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Generate W0 baseline and key-exposure audit fixtures.
+
+Writes:
+  - crates/aura-wallet/tests/fixtures/w0_baseline.txt
+  - crates/aura-wallet/tests/fixtures/w0_key_audit.txt (64 deterministic vectors)
